{"id":133919,"imdb":"tt6725014","en":"Scenes from a Marriage","orig":"Scener ur ett äktenskap","ar":null,"tag":null,"ov":"Johan and Marianne are married and seem to have it all. Their happiness, however, is a façade for a troubled relationship, which becomes even rockier when Johan admits that he's having an affair. Before long, the spouses separate and move towards finalizing their divorce, but they make attempts at reconciling. Even as they pursue other relationships, Johan and Marianne realize that they have a significant bond, but also many issues that hinder that connection.","rd":"1974-09-15","rt":169,"g":[18,10749],"lang":"sv","budget":150000,"revenue":0,"companies":[{"n":"Cinematograph AB","logo":null,"c":"SE"}],"countries":["SE"],"langs":["Swedish"],"col":"Scenes From A Marriage Collection","rel":[{"c":"US","d":"1974-09-15"},{"c":"SE","d":"1974-10-28"},{"c":"FR","d":"1975-01-22"},{"c":"DE","d":"1975-03-13"},{"c":"IT","d":"1975-04-18"},{"c":"FI","d":"1981-09-11"},{"c":"BR","d":"2000-01-01"},{"c":"GR","d":"2022-01-20"}],"dir":["Ingmar Bergman"],"prod":["Lars-Owe Carlberg"],"wri":["Ingmar Bergman"],"mus":[],"dop":["Sven Nykvist"],"cast":[{"n":"Liv Ullmann","ch":"Marianne","p":"/7IJimLbXIOYpLAS4UaHcNYWRsJe.jpg"},{"n":"Erland Josephson","ch":"Johan","p":"/dopG1nAzyT23DMAPyPoUuwbZs4a.jpg"},{"n":"Bibi Andersson","ch":"Katarina","p":"/6EGqmWOR3R3jv3IgrEZmCjTAVGv.jpg"},{"n":"Jan Malmsjö","ch":"Peter","p":"/w1x4KhyWndGgZYw772algFd1JBC.jpg"},{"n":"Gunnel Lindblom","ch":"Eva","p":"/93heWge7LBJtmTlvVUvCHRogcmJ.jpg"},{"n":"Wenche Foss","ch":"Modern","p":"/ykmuRavTewKPNL9sfXgLm1w5m9P.jpg"},{"n":"Bertil Norström","ch":"Arne","p":"/xW6LH00nlT4caCfG7DghzBXqM4G.jpg"},{"n":"Anita Wall","ch":"Mrs. Palm","p":"/kIXZcdOF1wV5YsKC5Lxq0dBX2xq.jpg"},{"n":"Rossana Mariano","ch":"Young Eva","p":null},{"n":"Lena Bergman","ch":"Karin","p":null},{"n":"Ingmar Bergman","ch":"Voice of the Press Photographer (uncredited)","p":"/nkmOaXNRoioViN9OQf2n9Iu6akA.jpg"},{"n":"Barbro Hiort af Ornäs","ch